---
description: |
  Normalizes a Kunai event to OCSF.

  ```tql
  from_file "kunai.json" {
    read_ndjson
  }
  kunai::ocsf::normalize
  ```

  Kunai writes one JSON object per event, which Tenzir reads natively, so the
  package starts at the mapper. The operator maps each event to the OCSF class
  that fits it. Whatever has no OCSF attribute remains under `unmapped`.

  Callers who already hold a structured Kunai event under another field, or who
  want to inspect and enrich the event before mapping, use `kunai::ocsf::map`.
args:
  positional:
    - name: kunai
      description: The structured Kunai event.
      type: field
      default: this
  named:
    - name: into
      description: The field that receives the OCSF event.
      type: field
      default: this
---

$into.kunai = $kunai
kunai::ocsf::map $into.kunai, $into.ocsf
$into = $into.ocsf
